OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia said it would "thoroughly
OL,7,Finvestigate" the incident but accused
OL,8,FDanish helicopters of making "dangerous
OL,9,Fmanoeuvres" near Russian warships.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
